      "id": "awkops-002",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "awk 记录处理",
      "knowledgePoint": "输出分隔符",
      "questionType": "代码与配置",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "awk 中 OFS 控制什么？",
      "answer": "控制 print 输出多个表达式时的字段分隔符。",
      "explanation": "它不同于控制输入字段切分的 FS。",
      "example": "awk 'BEGIN { OFS=\",\"; print 1,2 }' 输出 1,2。",
      "tags": [
        "awk 记录处理",
        "输出分隔符"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man1/awk.1p.html"
    },
    {
      "id": "awkops-003",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "awk 记录处理",
      "knowledgePoint": "预先传参",
      "questionType": "代码与配置",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "awk 的 -v name=value 为什么适合给 BEGIN 代码传值？",
      "answer": "-v 在执行程序之前赋值，因此 BEGIN 动作可以读取该变量。",
      "explanation": "传入的值应作为参数提供，避免把外部数据直接拼进程序文本。",
      "example": "awk -v limit=3 'BEGIN { print limit }'。",
      "tags": [
        "awk 记录处理",
        "预先传参"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man1/awk.1p.html"
